    "Receipts required for all individual expenses over $25 USD",
    "Loyalty miles and points may be retained by the traveler for personal use",
    "Upgrades using company funds are not permitted — traveler-paid upgrades are allowed",
    "Travel insurance is mandatory for international trips over 5 nights",
